BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Riceville Gathering: County Bonds on your Ballot Presentation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T163000
UID:09e21aea01c0fe5c5f7ab90faf2909ba@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Riceville_20260831234629923543.png
DESCRIPTION:The Riceville Engaged Action Gathering welcomes Commissioner T
 erri Wells for a presentation on the Open Space and Affordable Housing Bon
 ds that will be on your ballot this November. Terri will share an overview
  of the 2026 bonds and update us on the impacts of the 2022 bonds. There w
 ill be time for Q & A. After the Bonds presentation\, our group will plan 
 for voter outreach to our Riceville and Swannanoa neighbors as we start ou
 r BIG get out the vote efforts in the run up to early voting beginnin
LOCATION:Location will be sent to registrants\, 28805
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1002573/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
