 n 2027 - political\, social\, action events . . . . Who should attend: All
  Democratic Precinct 4.1 folks\, plus any who would like to attend from th
 e N. AVL Cluster or any other group of like-minded citizens to gather for 
 celebration\, company\, and comfort in shared beliefs.
